span.p:
Product-owned prepare route
One supervised parent before contract acquisition;
manual commands retain local source custody only

Source-duty inventory
Records product identity, performers, actions and targets;
marks declared workflow membership and recurring safeguards

Closed source result
Typed inventory or one material question;
inventory keeps every duty and exact source reference

Source identity and performer custody preflight
Resolve the product identity separately from actors;
retain exact performer quotes in normalized statements

Accepted EDIT baseline
Exact source addresses, action allocation edges and verification flags;
typed system roster retained under a bounded context

Source-only verifier
Affirms identity, complete duties, workflow roles and recurrence;
every surviving EDIT action keeps its exact allocation edges

One complete source-event graph
Fixed performers and event IDs come from verified actions;
a whole-product performer does not create another subsystem

One candidate authoring pass
Authors design using fixed events and accepted EDIT custody;
cannot erase accepted systems or reassign surviving prior actions

Deterministic validator and custody compiler
Rebuilds source product identity and the fixed actor/event catalog;
checks exact source spans, lifecycle, relations and hashes

Derived workflow and proposed first run
Workflow membership comes from verified source roles;
first run may add cited discrete prerequisites

Recurring safeguards
Keep conditional guards, lifecycle custody and proof;
remain outside the one-time run

Project summary and declared first path
Proposed implementation walkthrough stays separate;
evidence and record metadata remain in supporting details

Retain, clean, finish observer and completion-record I/O
Certify only within both final deadlines;
preserve the original EDIT seal and receipt

Completion receipt delivery
Private nonce issued after certification;
delivery follows measured preparation

EDIT
Reverify current source with the accepted baseline;
unsupported system roster changes refuse before candidate generation

Shared runtime supervision
300-second gate and candidate window plus 15-second reserve;
independent guardian cancels blocked work and child groups;
660-second whole cap remains diagnostic and unqualified

Frozen public source predicates
Exact forward coverage and reverse invention audit;
independent review binds retained evidence
